@@ PR3 | Agile | multi
Which two practices most directly shorten the time it takes for value to reach customers? (Choose two.)
A) Releasing in small batches
B) Limiting work in progress
C) Combining several releases into one larger release
D) Adding more approval steps before each release
E) Starting more features in parallel
= A, B
? Small batches and limited WIP improve flow and lead time. Larger releases, more approvals and more parallel work slow value delivery.

@@ PR4 | Predictive
