= A
? Timeboxes create focus, rhythm and predictability, and encourage prioritising the most important topics.

@@ PR8 | Predictive | fill
An activity has an optimistic estimate of 10 days, a most likely estimate of 14 days and a pessimistic estimate of 24 days. What is its PERT (beta) estimate in days?
= 15
? PERT = (O + 4M + P) / 6 = (10 + 56 + 24) / 6 = 90 / 6 = 15 days.

